# CI / Hooks

## Pre-commit & Pre-push (Husky)

Hooks live in `.husky/`. Both run `.config/bash/hook-checks.sh`:

1. `pnpm btest` — bash test suite (`bash .config/bash/tests/run.sh`)
2. `pnpm check` — Biome lint
3. `pnpm typeslint` — `tsc` for `@nucleify/web`
4. `pnpm slint` — Stylelint (SCSS)
5. `pnpm tests` — Vitest

## GitHub Actions

### `health-check.yml` (all branches)

Node 22, pnpm. Parallel jobs after setup: biome, typeslint, stylelint, build, test — delegate via monorepo `pnpm run …` → `@nucleify/web`.

### `bash.yaml`

Runs `bash .config/bash/tests/run.sh` on push.

### `release-modules.yml`

Reads `.config/bash/config/submodules.txt` for module release names.
